    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Process Order Sub-Workflow\n\nOwned By: Mekolle Ashley\nLast Updated: 11th Oct 2026\n\nCalled by: Order Webhook Processor\n\n## What it does\n1. Checks if order already exists (prevents duplicates)\n2. Inserts new orders into Data Table\n3. Calls processing API\n4. Updates order status in Order table\n5. Returns processing result to parent\n\n## Inputs\n- order_id (string)\n- customer_id (string)\n- total (number)\n\n## Returns\n- order_id\n- stored (boolean)\n- processing_result\n- processed_at\n\nPart of: n8n Foundations Program N8N102 Course, Section 2",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 544,
        "color": 4
      },
